{"title":"蓝桥杯真题解析：硬币兑换问题","slug":"2024-03-24-硬币兑换(-)","date":"2024-03-23T17:38:47.000Z","updated":"2024-03-23T17:38:47.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-03-24-硬币兑换(-).json","excerpt":null,"covers":["/images/LQ3501_1.png"],"content":"<h2 id=\"一、-题目背景\"><a href=\"#一、-题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 题目背景\"></a>一、 题目背景</h2><p>本题选自蓝桥杯竞赛试题，主要考察对模拟过程的理解以及数组下标的灵活运用。题目通常要求在特定规则下，计算兑换过程中的数值变化与最值求解。</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"/images/LQ3501_1.png\" alt=\"题目示意图\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"二、-题目分析与思路\"><a href=\"#二、-题目分析与思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、 题目分析与思路\"></a>二、 题目分析与思路</h2><p>根据题目逻辑（结合代码反推），我们需要处理的核心逻辑是：在给定的数值范围内，模拟兑换过程并统计结果。</p>\n<p><strong>核心逻辑分析：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据规模</strong>：涉及数值范围为 <code>1</code> 到 <code>2023</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>统计方式</strong>：使用一个数组 <code>result</code> 来记录特定数值出现的累积和。</li>\n<li><strong>双重循环枚举</strong>：<ul>\n<li>外层循环 <code>i</code> 从 <code>1</code> 遍历到 <code>2023</code>。</li>\n<li>内层循环 <code>j</code> 从 <code>i+1</code> 遍历到 <code>2023</code>，确保两两不同且不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>累加规则</strong>：对于每一对 <code>(i, j)</code>，将数值 <code>i</code> 累加到数组下标为 <code>i+j</code> 的位置上。</li>\n<li><strong>目标</strong>：最终求 <code>result</code> 数组中的最大值。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度估算：</strong><br>最大可能的下标和为 <code>2023 + 2023 = 4046</code>。因此，定义长度为 <code>4047</code> 的数组足以覆盖所有可能的下标索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三、-代码实现\"><a href=\"#三、-代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、 代码实现\"></a>三、 代码实现</h2><p>以下是经过规范化处理的 Python 代码实现。代码中添加了注释以便于理解，并优化了变量命名风格。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve_coin_exchange</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化结果数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 数组大小需覆盖最大可能的下标和 (2023 + 2023 = 4046)，故取 4047</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    result = [<span class=\"number\">0</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">4047</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 遍历范围 1 到 2023</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># range(1, 2024) 的区间为 [1, 2023]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2024</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2024</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 计算下标索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            idx = i + j</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 将 i 的值累加到对应索引位置</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            result[idx] += i</span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 输出数组中的最大值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(result))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    solve_coin_exchange()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 四、 运行结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">执行上述代码后，程序将输出最终的统计最大值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![运行结果截图](/images/LQ3501_2.png)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 五、 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">这道题属于典型的“暴力枚举 + 数组统计”类型。虽然使用了双重循环，但由于数据量级仅为 $O(N^<span class=\"number\">2</span>)$，对于 $N=<span class=\"number\">2023</span>$ 的情况，运算量级在百万级别，Python 解释器完全可以在短时间内得出结果。解决此类问题的关键在于：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  准确估算数组所需的最大空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  正确理解题目中的累加或统计逻辑。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  注意循环边界条件，避免数组越界或遗漏数据。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"一、-题目背景\"><a href=\"#一、-题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 题目背景\"></a>一、 题目背景</h2><p>本题选自蓝桥杯竞赛试题，主要考察对模拟过程的理解以及数组下标的灵活运用。题目通常要求在特定规则下，计算兑换过程中的数值变化与最值求解。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/LQ3501_1.png\" alt=\"题目示意图\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"二、-题目分析与思路\"><a href=\"#二、-题目分析与思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、 题目分析与思路\"></a>二、 题目分析与思路</h2><p>根据题目逻辑（结合代码反推），我们需要处理的核心逻辑是：在给定的数值范围内，模拟兑换过程并统计结果。</p>\n<p><strong>核心逻辑分析：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据规模</strong>：涉及数值范围为 <code>1</code> 到 <code>2023</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>统计方式</strong>：使用一个数组 <code>result</code> 来记录特定数值出现的累积和。</li>\n<li><strong>双重循环枚举</strong>：<ul>\n<li>外层循环 <code>i</code> 从 <code>1</code> 遍历到 <code>2023</code>。</li>\n<li>内层循环 <code>j</code> 从 <code>i+1</code> 遍历到 <code>2023</code>，确保两两不同且不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>累加规则</strong>：对于每一对 <code>(i, j)</code>，将数值 <code>i</code> 累加到数组下标为 <code>i+j</code> 的位置上。</li>\n<li><strong>目标</strong>：最终求 <code>result</code> 数组中的最大值。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度估算：</strong><br>最大可能的下标和为 <code>2023 + 2023 = 4046</code>。因此，定义长度为 <code>4047</code> 的数组足以覆盖所有可能的下标索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三、-代码实现\"><a href=\"#三、-代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、 代码实现\"></a>三、 代码实现</h2><p>以下是经过规范化处理的 Python 代码实现。代码中添加了注释以便于理解，并优化了变量命名风格。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve_coin_exchange</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化结果数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 数组大小需覆盖最大可能的下标和 (2023 + 2023 = 4046)，故取 4047</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    result = [<span class=\"number\">0</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">4047</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 遍历范围 1 到 2023</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># range(1, 2024) 的区间为 [1, 2023]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2024</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2024</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 计算下标索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            idx = i + j</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"comment\"># 将 i 的值累加到对应索引位置</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            result[idx] += i</span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 输出数组中的最大值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(result))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    solve_coin_exchange()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 四、 运行结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">执行上述代码后，程序将输出最终的统计最大值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">![运行结果截图](/images/LQ3501_2.png)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 五、 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">这道题属于典型的“暴力枚举 + 数组统计”类型。虽然使用了双重循环，但由于数据量级仅为 $O(N^<span class=\"number\">2</span>)$，对于 $N=<span class=\"number\">2023</span>$ 的情况，运算量级在百万级别，Python 解释器完全可以在短时间内得出结果。解决此类问题的关键在于：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  准确估算数组所需的最大空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  正确理解题目中的累加或统计逻辑。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  注意循环边界条件，避免数组越界或遗漏数据。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法竞赛","path":"api/categories/算法竞赛.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"Algorithm","path":"api/tags/Algorithm.json"}]}